| 0x0009 | GET_STREAM_FORMAT | shall | — | RO_SNAPSHOT | no | yes | no | — | 16 | 36 B (cdl 24) | SUCCESS, NO_SUCH_DESCRIPTOR, BAD_ARGUMENTS, NOT_SUPPORTED |
